WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.168 --> 00:00:03.670 line:0%
 
- WHAT A MIND-BLOWING FINISH
TO AN INCREDIBLE GAME TONIGHT,

00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:06.573 line:0%
 
WITH CHARLIE SANDERS
WINNING THE GAME

00:00:06.607 --> 00:00:09.142 line:0%
 
IN LITERALLY
THE LAST SECOND.

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:10.844 line:0%
 
UNBELIEVABLE,
TRULY SPECTACULAR.

00:00:10.878 --> 00:00:12.679
CHARLIE SANDERS,
HOW DOES IT FEEL?

00:00:12.713 --> 00:00:15.082
- HEY, YO, I WANNA SAY SOMETHIN'
TO EVERYBODY WATCHIN'.

00:00:15.115 --> 00:00:17.885
YO, YOU CAN DO ANYTHING!
ANYTHING'S POSSIBLE!

00:00:17.918 --> 00:00:19.386
THE WORLD IS YOURS!

00:00:19.419 --> 00:00:20.854
- AND CHARLIE,
DID YOU THINK THAT THAT GAME

00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:22.523
WAS GONNA END
THAT WAY TONIGHT?

00:00:22.556 --> 00:00:24.892
- YO, THERE ARE NO LIMITS,
ALL RIGHT?

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:27.094
YOU CAN SWIM
ACROSS THE ATLANTIC.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.162
YOU CAN JUMP REAL HIGH
AND TOUCH THE MOON!

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:33.066
- FANTASTIC. CHARLIE SANDERS,
FRESH OFF OF HIS, UH, VICTORY.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.102
I JUST FEEL LIKE HE'S READY
TO TOUCH THE MOON.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:38.372
- I CAN FLY!
ANYBODY CAN FLY!

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.873
IF YOU BELIEVE IN YOURSELF

00:00:39.907 --> 00:00:41.742
THE WAY I BELIEVE
IN MYSELF TONIGHT,

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:43.744
YOU WILL FLY!

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.879
- AND WHAT'S NEXT FOR CHARLIE
SANDERS AND THE ORANGE--

00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:48.916
- KIDS,
YOU CAN ACTUALLY FLY!

00:00:48.949 --> 00:00:50.417
- NO--NO, NOT--
OH, NOT LITERALLY, OF COURSE.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.419
- YES! LITERALLY! KIDS!

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:55.556
YOUNG KIDS, I WANT YOU TO GO
UP ON YOUR ROOFS RIGHT NOW!

00:00:55.589 --> 00:00:57.925
- WAIT, WHAT?
- FLY INTO THE NIGHT SKY!

00:00:57.958 --> 00:00:59.893
- OKAY.
- PEOPLE WILL SEE YOU FLYING!

00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:02.696
AND THEN YOU CAN DO ANYTHING!
YOU CAN DO ANYTHING!

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.065
- OKAY, WELL, WE--WE--WE--
WE JUST WANT TO REMIND THE KIDS

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:07.434
THAT OF COURSE,
YOU CANNOT ACTUALLY FLY, KIDS.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:09.236
- YO, SCREW THAT
NEGATIVITY, MAN!

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:12.606
HEY, BOYS AND GIRLS,
AGES 8 THROUGH 12!

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:16.310
YO, DON'T LET NOBODY EVER TELL
YOU WHAT YOU CAN AND CANNOT DO!

00:01:16.343 --> 00:01:19.746
ALL THE PRETEEN CHILDREN
OUT THERE, LISTEN TO MY VOICE!

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.216
YOU ARE IMMORTAL!

00:01:22.249 --> 00:01:24.218
- OKAY, WELL, OBVIOUSLY,
WE UNDERSTAND THAT CHARLIE...

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:26.320
- [groaning, shouting]
- IS SUPER EXCITED RIGHT NOW,

00:01:26.353 --> 00:01:29.423
AND THAT NO ONE IS ACTUALLY
IMMORTAL, NOBODY AT ALL.

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.757
- HEY, KIDS!

00:01:30.791 --> 00:01:32.726
YOU CAN TURN YOURSELF
INTO A CAR

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:35.596
AND HAVE A FRIEND
DRIVE YOU ONTO THE FREEWAY!

00:01:35.629 --> 00:01:36.930
- OKAY, NO--WELL, THAT'S
JUST A METAPHOR, KIDS.

00:01:36.964 --> 00:01:38.498
- IT'S NOT!
- JUST A METAPHOR--

00:01:38.532 --> 00:01:40.767
- YOU STILL HAVE THE POWER
OF CHILDISH INNOCENCE!

00:01:40.801 --> 00:01:42.603
GET A FRIEND ON YOUR BACK,

00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:45.973
AND MAKE A BEELINE FOR THE NEXT
RAMP TO THE FREEWAY, Y'ALL!

00:01:46.006 --> 00:01:47.341
- OKAY, DON'T DO ANY--
- TO THE FREEWAY!

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:49.243
- HE'S SPEAKING
FIGURATIVELY, FOLKS.

00:01:49.276 --> 00:01:52.179
- ONCE YOU GET THERE, AIN'T
NOTHING FIGURATIVE ABOUT THIS!

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:54.815
YOU WILL TURN INTO A ROBOT!

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:57.251 line:0%
 
FIRST AND FOREMOST,
I JUST WANT TO SAY

00:01:57.284 --> 00:02:01.788 line:0%
 
TO ALL THE FAMILIES
WHO LOST CHILDREN, I'M SORRY.

00:02:01.822 --> 00:02:04.758 line:0%
 
MY STATEMENTS
WERE IRRESPONSIBLE.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:07.261 line:0%
 
I HAVE SUBSEQUENTLY
LOOKED UP

00:02:07.294 --> 00:02:11.331 line:0%
 
THE TERMS "LITERALLY"
AND "METAPHORICALLY,"

00:02:11.365 --> 00:02:15.302 line:0%
 
AND FOUND THAT WHEREAS
I WAS NOT INCORRECT,

00:02:15.335 --> 00:02:17.304 line:0%
 
THEY DID NOT MEAN
WHAT I THOUGHT THEY MEANT.

